## Summary

Augment `--help` for each subcommand with realistic examples (filters, paging, JSON piping).

## Scope

- `packages`, `quals`, `units`, `ss`, `show`, `index-info`, `index-search`, `search`, `compare`

## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] Each subcommand has 2–3 examples showing common workflows
- [ ] Examples are tested to ensure they run as documented
- [ ] README/manpage updated accordingly

